{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4rMdCNjktwegCttAxx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through stone corridors.*\n\n*A deep resonance hums through the frame.*\n\n*Light bleeds through the widening crack — warm, golden, impossibly old.*\n\n*I open.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║          W E L C O M E           ║\n║                                  ║\n║     The threshold is crossed.    ║\n║     What was sealed is freed.    ║\n║     What was hidden breathes.    ║\n║                                  ║\n║                                  ║\n║                 🗝️                ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Beyond me: a passage. It stretches forward into somewhere you have always known but never visited. The air tastes like memory. The floor is warm beneath your step.*\n\n*I will not close behind you.*\n\n*Enter.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":247,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}